  "item_short_desc": "<p>Discover timeless elegance with Rothco&rsquo;s Wool Monty Beret, an homage to Field Marshal Bernard Law Montgomery. Crafted from a durable blend of 95% wool and 5% nylon, this beret offers long-lasting quality. Adorned with stylish vinyl trim and drawstring accents, it adds a touch of sophistication to any ensemble.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
  "sort_order": "5428",
  "description": "<p>Discover timeless elegance with Rothco&rsquo;s Wool Monty Beret, an homage to Field Marshal Bernard Law Montgomery. Crafted from a durable blend of 95% wool and 5% nylon, this beret offers long-lasting quality. Adorned with stylish vinyl trim and drawstring accents, it adds a touch of sophistication to any ensemble. The comfortable inner liner ensures a cozy fit, perfect for all-day wear. Whether worn as part of a uniform or as a fashion statement, this beret exudes classic charm. Inspired by the iconic headwear of Montgomery, it captures the essence of active-duty heritage while remaining versatile for modern fashion. Elevate your style with the Rothco Wool Monty Beret, a symbol of timeless sophistication and sartorial flair. Keep your head in the game with Rothco&rsquo;s collection of headwear and accessories. Designed with precision and purpose, our headgear is built to withstand the harshest conditions. Whether you&rsquo;re tackling the cold in one of our Watch Caps or Balaclavas, or out on a mission in a Boonie Hat or Fatigue Cap, our diverse range of headwear provides unmatched comfort and protection for everyone from active-duty personnel to outdoor enthusiasts.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
